<title>CANADA: Toronto exchange expects Bre-X statement.</title>
<headline>Toronto exchange expects Bre-X statement.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Toronto Stock Exchange said on Thursday it expected Bre-X Minerals Ltd to issue a further news release today.</p>
<p>The exchange said the stock would remain halted in the interim.</p>
<p>Bre-X said in a statement on Wednesday there appeared to be a &quot;strong possibility&quot; that the potential gold resources on the Busang project in Indonesia had been overstated due to invalid samples and assays of those samples.</p>
<p>The stock did not trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
